# Code of Conduct

## Our Pledge
We pledge to make participation in our project a welcoming and respectful experience for everyone.

## Our Standards
- Be respectful and considerate.
- Welcome different opinions and experiences.
- Accept constructive feedback.
- Focus on what is best for the community.

## Enforcement Responsibilities
Project maintainers are responsible for clarifying and enforcing our standards of acceptable behavior.

## Scope
This Code of Conduct applies to all project spaces and public interactions related to the project.

## Enforcement
Instances of abusive, harassing, or unacceptable behavior may be reported to the project maintainers.

## Enforcement Guidelines
Project maintainers will review reports and take appropriate action based on the circumstances.

## Attribution
This Code of Conduct is adapted from the Contributor Covenant.
